      "message": "hey the GPIO configuration system supports setting a gpio as active low as a gpio flag, could you do this by changing the flag for the corresponding pin in an overlay?\n\nguess it\u0027s\n\n```\n                gpio_en_pp5000_usba_r: en_pp5000_usba_r {\n                        gpios \u003d \u003c\u0026gpiod 7 GPIO_OUTPUT\u003e;\n                };\n```\n\nyou should be able to change it by adding an overlaying with something like\n```\n\u0026gpio_en_pp5000_usba_r {\n\tgpios \u003d \u003c\u0026gpiod 7 (GPIO_OUTPUT | GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW)\u003e;\n}\n```",
